><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is connected across a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.448ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 2850 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">\u00a0</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"56\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-56\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> supply. The power dissipation of the bulb is:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"100 W"},{"identifier":"B","content":"50 W"},{"identifier":"C","content":"12.5 W"},{"identifier":"D","content":"25 W"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>To find the power dissipation of the bulb when it's connected to a <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.09ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2250 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"